# MCP server config — per-machine, and per-PROJECT on purpose.
#
# It holds no secret: the token is referenced as ${GITHUB_TOKEN_WEBSITE} and
# read from the shell at launch, so what is written here is a variable NAME.
# Ignored anyway, because this file is how one machine's project points at one
# GitHub identity, and that is a local choice rather than a repo fact.
.mcp.json
